ing, nearly every expert rater still calls the race Likely Democratic, and prediction markets price Flanagan around 90%. The forecast lands on a modest Democratic lead with elevated uncertainty, reflecting the gap between recent polling and longer-run fundamentals in a state that has leaned Democratic by about three points recently.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.8725, "margin": 5.75}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7776, "margin": 4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.8131, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.8217, "margin": 4.5}]}